chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does chapter 16 of the 3rd edition teach about databases and the sqlite3 module, which of its printed outputs, programs and statements still hold under Python 3.14.6 with SQLite 3.53.1 and the shell of release 3.54.0, and what must an advanced course correct or add so that it matches current Python and SQLite?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-12." .
